### 1.4 Admin Role Management System

Admin gets a dedicated **User Roles & Permissions** panel:

- **Role Assignment**: Admin searches user by phone/name → assigns role from dropdown → user's app view changes instantly
- **Role Approval Queue**: When user requests role upgrade (e.g., "I want to become a delivery agent"), it goes to admin approval queue
- **Multi-Role Support**: One user can have multiple roles (e.g., Resident + Shop Owner) with a role switcher in the app
- **Role-Specific Onboarding**: When admin assigns "Delivery Agent" role, the user sees a delivery-specific onboarding flow (upload documents, vehicle details, etc.)
- **Permission Override**: Admin can grant/revoke specific module access per user (e.g., block a user from marketplace but keep everything else)
- **Bulk Role Assignment**: Admin can assign roles in bulk (e.g., assign "Resident Member" to all users from a specific society)

