## 3. Shop Owner Order Ringing System (Swiggy/Zomato Style)

> [!IMPORTANT]
> When a new order or appointment is placed, the shop owner's mobile phone must **ring loudly and continuously** with a distinct order sound — exactly like Swiggy/Zomato merchant apps. The ring continues until the shop owner accepts or declines.

