### 3.2 Technical Implementation

| Component | Technology |
|-----------|-----------|
| **Push Notification** | Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM) with `priority: "high"` and `android_channel_id: "order_alerts"` |
| **Sound** | Custom `.mp3` order alert sound (loud, 10-second loop) bundled with app. Plays at MAX volume |
| **Vibration** | Continuous vibration pattern: `[0, 500, 200, 500, 200, 500]` repeating |
| **Wake Lock** | `expo-keep-awake` + Android Wake Lock to turn on screen |
| **Auto-Decline Timer** | 60-second countdown. If no action → order marked "declined" → re-routed to another nearby shop or cancelled |
| **Background Alert** | FCM data message triggers foreground service even when app is killed |
| **Real-time Socket** | Socket.io `order:new` event for instant in-app alert |
| **Sound Channel** | Android Notification Channel `order_alerts` with `importance: IMPORTANCE_HIGH` and custom sound |

### 3.3 Shop Owner Rating System

| Metric | How It's Calculated | Impact |
|--------|-------------------|--------|
| **Order Acceptance Rate** | Accepted ÷ Total received (last 30 days) | Below 80% → warning, below 60% → temporary suspension |
| **Average Response Time** | Time between order notification → accept/decline | Displayed to customers |
| **Customer Rating** | 1-5 stars after order completion | Shown on shop listing |
| **On-Time Delivery Rate** | Orders delivered within estimated time | Ranking boost |
| **Cancellation Rate** | Cancelled after acceptance ÷ Total accepted | Below 5% → penalty |
| **Appointment No-Show Rate** | No-shows ÷ Total appointments | Affects visibility |

